UID:ad51e541c0c8@community-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261112T190023Z
DTSTART:20261202T140000
DTEND:20261202T163000
SUMMARY:Kim Yerton Library\, Free Tech Support with Acorn Wireless (By App
 ointment)
LOCATION:Kim Yerton Memorial Library\, 370 Loop Rd
DESCRIPTION:If you want to learn how to use your own online device\, creat
 e an account for an email\, or get started on the internet\, help is here
 ! Stop by the Kim Yerton Memorial Hoopa Branch Library and talk to Acorn 
 Wireless’s expert Digital Navigator\, Abraham Camez. He’ll get you st
 arted and help you over any stumbling blocks. Acorn Wireless is a triball
 y owned internet service provider operated by the Hoopa Valley Public Uti
 lities District. It was started in 2020 from CARES funding approved by th
 e Hoopa Valley Tribal Council and supports Hoopa Valley people in key act
 ivities like distance learning\, remote work\, and telemedicine. Acorn pr
 ovides high-speed broadband internet for the Hoopa Community....\nhttps:/
 /willowcreekchamber.com/event/kim-yerton-library-free-tech-support-with-a
 corn-wireless-by-appointment/2026-12-02/
URL:https://willowcreekchamber.com/event/kim-yerton-library-free-tech-supp
 ort-with-acorn-wireless-by-appointment/2026-12-02/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:c4fd650f53de@community-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261112T190023Z
DTSTART:20261202T170000
DTEND:20261202T194500
SUMMARY:Kim Yerton Library\, Cribbage & Game Night
LOCATION:Kim Yerton Memorial Library\, 370 Loop Rd
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun and friendly Cribbage & Board Game Night at 
 the library! Whether you’re a seasoned cribbage player or just learning
  the game\, come enjoy an evening of strategy and good company. We provid
 e boards and cards\, but feel free to bring your own. Not into Cribbage? 
 No problem! We have a variety of board games for all ages\, so bring the 
 whole family and find a game to enjoy together. From classics like Checke
 rs and Clue to trivia challenges and more\, there’s something for every
 one. All ages are welcome – come by to play\, relax\, and make new frie
 nds. Every Wednesday evening starting at 5 p.m.\nhttps://willowcreekchamb
 er.com/event/kim-yerton-library-cribbage-game-night/2026-12-02/
URL:https://willowcreekchamber.com/event/kim-yerton-library-cribbage-game-
 night/2026-12-02/
END:VEVENT
